{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_176eff959fd3209e10242289aba17b70941af137da20ddaf24383bb71e371cbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.local.md documents maintainer steps for updating the IPFS/Pinata plugin registry (fetch registry, edit entries, pin via Pinata API, update LIVE_REGISTRY_CID) and warns never to hardcode API keys or commit .env."}],"claim_ids":["clm_176eff959fd3209e10242289aba17b70941af137da20ddaf24383bb71e371cbc"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:18:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_0947b00384cb46068faf90d93814ed98","id":"pg_3dcae3acc7325bdba3a5fa0245649192","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/ruvnet-ruflo-claude-local-md-b02c0cacec22-fa0245649192.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5b6ebc0ee7a1506d9ab600c61d07f7eb"],"title":"ruvnet/ruflo/CLAUDE.local.md @ b02c0cacec22","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:18:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0947b00384cb46068faf90d93814ed98"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_347620a1aae111431e019ceac8461e9108c8342e4265ddf9a5c493c4136f4b2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The ruflo-core plugin registers its own MCP server with namespaced tool names like mcp__plugin_ruflo-core_ruflo__memory_store, differing from the CLI-track bare tool names."},{"claim_ids":["clm_368cccabb9a6e034c593cb88ac731f155daffe26bf5cd75f1ef9b907ffa747d0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Two install paths exist: Claude Code plugins (slash commands, zero workspace files) versus full CLI init which scaffolds .claude/, .claude-flow/, CLAUDE.md, hooks, and an MCP server."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54fbbe540ff43991766b97c2ac9c18b404f51aa3f62b7a746a5573880e71e60e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Ruflo exposes a CLI (npx ruflo) and an MCP server; the README shows registering it in Claude Code via 'claude mcp add claude-flow -- npx ruflo@latest mcp start'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_60db2f3bc01d70d84f90d5ffeced1e6854c758e9968c3b3e75c41094a026e8d7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Swarm coordination supports hierarchical, mesh, and adaptive topologies with consensus, and the architecture diagram shows a Queen-led coordination layer above 100+ specialized agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_690fbaed7928b895e91d8b291672cd5aa9ec829d414cdaf04c6d3652f60b3b1d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent federation lets agents on different machines discover, authenticate (mTLS + ed25519), and exchange work, with PII stripped from outbound messages and per-trust-level policies (BLOCK, REDACT, HASH, PASS)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9947260fb2645b1bd1fdd2381a9874cf85a24cec68076dab42bf315c219d9f42"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README catalogs 35 plugins across categories including core/orchestration, memory, intelligence, testing, security, and domain-specific (e.g. ruflo-swarm, ruflo-rag-memory, ruflo-neural-trader)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9d9601bbc8c2a3e3ff995385bea59953034b5470c5396c356949ff84c4b3c9f1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime supports multiple LLM providers — Claude, GPT, Gemini, Cohere, and Ollama — with smart routing and failover."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b3ae703a8c3388da567d8631d1e283a97569248acc465fd99f213b3f748dfc78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memory uses an HNSW-indexed AgentDB; the README cites measured ~1.9x faster at N=20k versus brute force with recall@10 near 0.99, noting ANN ties or loses at small N."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fa00bbe48e779308ee42f9c3cbbc11871d6ed4e73d9913eba53a2c1f1e418bec"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A SOTA comparator benchmark suite compares ruflo against LangGraph, AutoGen, and CrewAI on metrics like cold start, single turn, and RSS, with published matrix JSON for darwin and linux."}],"claim_ids":["clm_347620a1aae111431e019ceac8461e9108c8342e4265ddf9a5c493c4136f4b2c","clm_368cccabb9a6e034c593cb88ac731f155daffe26bf5cd75f1ef9b907ffa747d0","clm_54fbbe540ff43991766b97c2ac9c18b404f51aa3f62b7a746a5573880e71e60e","clm_60db2f3bc01d70d84f90d5ffeced1e6854c758e9968c3b3e75c41094a026e8d7","clm_690fbaed7928b895e91d8b291672cd5aa9ec829d414cdaf04c6d3652f60b3b1d","clm_9947260fb2645b1bd1fdd2381a9874cf85a24cec68076dab42bf315c219d9f42","clm_9d9601bbc8c2a3e3ff995385bea59953034b5470c5396c356949ff84c4b3c9f1","clm_b3ae703a8c3388da567d8631d1e283a97569248acc465fd99f213b3f748dfc78","clm_fa00bbe48e779308ee42f9c3cbbc11871d6ed4e73d9913eba53a2c1f1e418bec"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:18:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_0947b00384cb46068faf90d93814ed98","id":"pg_4e77bad0aaed54dbb2934508f9a725ea","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/ruvnet-ruflo-readme-md-b02c0cacec22-4508f9a725ea.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_f029307c6c885aa18a3f5ee2b376a1d4"],"title":"ruvnet/ruflo/README.md @ b02c0cacec22","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:18:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0947b00384cb46068faf90d93814ed98"}
